SOURCE DATA
The estimates are derived from National Health and Nutrition Examination Survey
(NHANES) public-use files produced by the National Center for Health Statistics,
Centers for Disease Control and Prevention. Those files are works of the U.S.
Government and are in the public domain. No NHANES microdata are redistributed
in this repository; only aggregate statistics computed from them.
